# local scratch
Archive/
.vercel

# Appended by tooling. `.env*` is the right default, but .env.example is the
# tracked contract a fresh clone copies from — negate it explicitly so the file
# cannot quietly vanish from the repo if it is ever deleted and recreated.
.env*
!.env.example
